{"id":"dc83381d408d9aef","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-df-zfc-model8-pointwise-definable-model.md","title":"ZFC Model8 Pointwise Definable Model","display":"df-zfc-model8-pointwise-definable-model — ZFC Model8 Pointwise Definable Model","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-model8-pointwise-definable-model","aliases":["58-df-zfc-model8-pointwise-definable-model"],"display":"df-zfc-model8-pointwise-definable-model — ZFC Model8 Pointwise Definable Model","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-assignment.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-model8-pointwise-definable-model"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-model8-pointwise-definable-model</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-model8-pointwise-definable-model — ZFC Model8 Pointwise Definable Model"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md\">../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"64f35ba2e87964e0\" href=\"?note=64f35ba2e87964e0\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-assignment.md\">../batch03/58-df-assignment.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"715a32e91161b34f\" href=\"?note=715a32e91161b34f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md\">../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\in V\">\\(M\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S(M,L)\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S(M,L)\\)</span> (structure predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Univ}(M)\">\\(\\mathrm{Univ}(M)\\)</span> (structure universe operator, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (typed satisfaction recursion, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md\">../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assign}\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Assign}\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s[v_0\\mapsto x]\">\\(s[v_0\\mapsto x]\\)</span> (assignments and update, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"64f35ba2e87964e0\" href=\"?note=64f35ba2e87964e0\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-assignment.md\">../batch03/58-df-assignment.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}_L\\)</span> (formula set and free-variable operator, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"715a32e91161b34f\" href=\"?note=715a32e91161b34f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md\">../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_0\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\">\\(v_0\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\)</span> (distinguished variable)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel8PointwiseDefinableModel}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel8PointwiseDefinableModel}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model8\\text{-}pointwise\\text{-}definable\\text{-}model}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel8PointwiseDefinableModel}_S(M)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(M,L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(M)\\;\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\\;\\exists s\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{FV}_L(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_0\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{Assign}(M,s)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall y\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(M)\\;\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s[v_0\\mapsto y])\\leftrightarrow y=x\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model8\\text{-}pointwise\\text{-}definable\\text{-}model}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel8PointwiseDefinableModel}_S(M)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(M,L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(M)\\;\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\\;\\exists s\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{FV}_L(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_0\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{Assign}(M,s)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall y\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(M)\\;\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s[v_0\\mapsto y])\\leftrightarrow y=x\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Every element is uniquely defined by a formula whose only possible free variable is <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_0\">\\(v_0\\)</span>. The satisfaction recursion and assignment are selected explicitly, so no parameter-free meta-level satisfaction abbreviation remains hidden.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md","status":"resolved","id":"8b6a90316aad78a4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-structure.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-assignment.md","status":"resolved","id":"64f35ba2e87964e0","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-assignment.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md","status":"resolved","id":"715a32e91161b34f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-structure.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Struct}_S(M,L)$ (structure predicate, see [[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-structure.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Univ}(M)$ (structure universe operator, see [[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md","status":"resolved","id":"8b6a90316aad78a4","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S\\subseteq V^4$ (typed satisfaction recursion, see [[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-assignment.md","status":"resolved","id":"64f35ba2e87964e0","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Assign}\\subseteq V^2$ and $s[v_0\\mapsto x]$ (assignments and update, see [[../batch03/58-df-assignment.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)$ and $\\operatorname{FV}_L$ (formula set and free-variable operator, see [[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]] and [[../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md","status":"resolved","id":"715a32e91161b34f","anchor":"ref-12","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypot